anga Entertainment"}],"synopsis":{"language":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"Demons exist and their power is beyond what humans can fathom. In fact, they are so strong that humans do not stand a chance against them in a fight.\n\nThe only thing strong enough to defeat a demon is another demon, and it is through this logic that Ryo Asuka hatches the plan to have his good-hearted friend, Akira Fudo, possessed by a demon. If a person is of pure of heart, then they might be able to control the demon that possesses them, and thereby acquire power equal to a demon. After raising some hell in a club, the plan works, and Akira is possessed by the powerful demon known as Amon.\n\nNow Akira is humanity's sole champion of justice against the hidden demon menace that has plagued humanity since the dawn of time.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"},"tags":[{"name":"Demons","rank":100,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gore","rank":91,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":87,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":85,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Body Horror","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shapeshifting","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Philosophy","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Mythology","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Dystopian","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban","rank":53,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Henshin","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Devilman: The Demon Bird","english":"Devilman: The Demon Bird","native":"デビルマン 妖鳥シレーヌ編","romaji":"Devilman: Youchou Sirene-hen","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"デビルマン 妖鳥死麗濡編"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"恶魔人 妖鸟死丽濡篇"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Devilman: Youchou Sirene Hen"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Devilman (1990)"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}